- content_for :page_header do
  = render "layouts/components/page_header", title: @account.name

.mb-6.p-4.bg-white.rounded-lg.border.border-gray-100.text-sm.text-gray-700
  p
    | #{@account.kind_label} de #{@account.legal_entity&.name} · compte général #{@account.general_account}
  p.mt-1.text-xs.text-gray-500
    | L'IBAN relie les relevés CODA et les exports Beobank à ce compte. Deux comptes ne portent jamais le même IBAN.

= form_with model: [:finance, @account], class: "space-y-4" do |f|
  .grid.gap-4(class="md:grid-cols-2")
    div
      = f.label :iban, "IBAN", class: "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700"
      = f.text_field :iban, label: false, placeholder: "BE00 0000 0000 0000", autocomplete: "off",
                     class: "mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 font-mono shadow-sm focus:border-indigo-500 focus:ring-indigo-500"
      p.mt-1.text-xs.text-gray-500 Les espaces sont libres. Laisser vide pour retirer l'IBAN.
  .flex.items-center.gap-3
    = f.submit "Enregistrer", class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-md border border-transparent bg-4s-main px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow-sm hover:opacity-90"
    = link_to "Annuler", finance_cash_accounts_path, class: "text-sm text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700"
